{"type":"text","timestamp":1794349693804,"sessionID":"ses_e386cd387ffeGJ3KEnYGDpYp5r","part":{"id":"prt_1c7937b44001Sh9YHyCEQc1U9o","messageID":"msg_1c7936ad2001LtiM0VT3MOhz42","sessionID":"ses_e386cd387ffeGJ3KEnYGDpYp5r","type":"text","text":"<think>Now let me plan. I'll create a todo list.\n\nKey considerations:\n1. Backend API with Flask, SQLite at ./data (relative to working dir /app).\n2. Frontend React + TS with Tailwind CSS. Need to add tailwind dependency — check network access to npm registry.\n\nLet me check network access first.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794349693764,"end":1794349693785}}}
