{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794350526949,"sessionID":"ses_e386cd387ffeGJ3KEnYGDpYp5r","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call-01054e61-3be3-488b-aeba-26b23199805e","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /workspace/frontend && timeout 300 npx vitest run 2>&1 | grep -E \"(✓|×|→)\" | head -40","timeout":330000},"output":"   ✓ inventory app > shows the inventory to anonymous visitors 248ms\n   ✓ inventory app > registers an account and signs the user in  500ms\n   ✓ inventory app > signs in again after a reload  493ms\n   × inventory app > adds an item and rejects a duplicate sku 1483ms\n     → Found multiple elements with the text: Widget\n   × inventory app > flags low stock items and filters them 1446ms\n     → Unable to find an element with the text: Low-aeb9ws. This could be because the text is broken up by multiple elements. In this case, you can provide a function for your text matcher to make your matcher more flexible.\n   × inventory app > records movements on the item page 1463ms\n     → Unable to find an element with the text: Widget-d645ve. This could be because the text is broken up by multiple elements. In this case, you can provide a function for your text matcher to make your matcher more flexible.\n   × inventory app > deletes an item after confirmation 1395ms\n     → Unable to find an element with the text: Widget-6znl8t. This could be because the text is broken up by multiple elements. In this case, you can provide a function for your text matcher to make your matcher more flexible.\n   ✓ inventory app > signs the user out 248ms\n","metadata":{"output":"   ✓ inventory app > shows the inventory to anonymous visitors 248ms\n   ✓ inventory app > registers an account and signs the user in  500ms\n   ✓ inventory app > signs in again after a reload  493ms\n   × inventory app > adds an item and rejects a duplicate sku 1483ms\n     → Found multiple elements with the text: Widget\n   × inventory app > flags low stock items and filters them 1446ms\n     → Unable to find an element with the text: Low-aeb9ws. This could be because the text is broken up by multiple elements. In this case, you can provide a function for your text matcher to make your matcher more flexible.\n   × inventory app > records movements on the item page 1463ms\n     → Unable to find an element with the text: Widget-d645ve. This could be because the text is broken up by multiple elements. In this case, you can provide a function for your text matcher to make your matcher more flexible.\n   × inventory app > deletes an item after confirmation 1395ms\n     → Unable to find an element with the text: Widget-6znl8t. This could be because the text is broken up by multiple elements. In this case, you can provide a function for your text matcher to make your matcher more flexible.\n   ✓ inventory app > signs the user out 248ms\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"cd /workspace/frontend && timeout 300 npx vitest run 2>&1 | grep -E \"(✓|×|→)\" | head -40","time":{"start":1794350516068,"end":1794350526905}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c7a0075c001RBmpBMc8JViqst","sessionID":"ses_e386cd387ffeGJ3KEnYGDpYp5r","messageID":"msg_1c79ffe1c001arkJx4GumdLJXr"}}
